    <bpmn:process id="W_W377" name="W377. Domain, SSL &amp; Digital Certificate Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New application rollout; or 60 days prior to certificate/domain expiration
Frequency: Ongoing; Monthly inventory check
Volume: ~30+ public domains; ~100+ SSL certificates (wildcard and single-domain)
Owner: IT Infrastructure Lead
Participants: Network Engineer, Security Analyst, DevOps, Finance (for payment)
Source: workflow W377 — Domain, SSL &amp; Digital Certificate Management</bpmn:documentation>
