    <bpmn:process id="W_W5522" name="W5522. ISMS Program, Security Certification &amp; Security-Policy Lifecycle (ISO/IEC 27001)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual ISMS risk-assessment &amp; management-review cycle; ISO/IEC 27001 surveillance or recertification audit; new NPC advisory or material scope change (new built product, VS-190 OT interface); or a material security-policy review falling due
Frequency: Annual risk assessment &amp; management review; annual surveillance audit on a 3-year recertification cycle; continuous policy upkeep
Volume: ISMS scope: HQ + 4 DCs + 200 stores (~2,500 endpoints, ~6,911 identities) plus VS-190 OT interfaces; ~93 Annex A controls in the SoA; ~15–25 policy documents
Owner: IT Compliance Lead (accountable: CIO)
Participants: IT Security Manager, Data Protection Officer, Internal Audit, Head of Engineering, IT Infrastructure Manager, HR/L&amp;D (W372 awareness program), TPRM Program Manager (W4730)
Source: workflow W5522 — ISMS Program, Security Certification &amp; Security-Policy Lifecycle (ISO/IEC 27001)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5522_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5522_Lane1" name="IT Compliance Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5522_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5522_Start3" name="Annual ISMS risk-assessment &amp; management-review cycle; ISO/IEC 27001 surveillance or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5522_Task4" name="Scope &amp; SoA upkeep">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Scope &amp; SoA upkeep: Maintain the ISMS scope statement (enterprise IT; interfaces to the VS-190 OT scope and the VS-113 built products) and the Statement of Applicability across Annex A controls
Responsible (R): IT Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 16 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5522_Task5" name="Annual risk-assessment cycle">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Annual risk-assessment cycle: Refresh the threat/risk register with control owners; raise treatment plans; route risk acceptances (links to W3256 asset risk register, W3590 architecture risk)
Responsible (R): IT Compliance Lead / IT Security Mgr
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 40 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5522_Task6" name="Security-policy hierarchy lifecycle">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Security-policy hierarchy lifecycle: Author, review and approve the policy set (CIO approval; annual review dates; version control per VS-88)
Responsible (R): IT Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 24 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5522_Task7" name="Internal audit program">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Internal audit program: Plan and support the annual internal ISMS audit; track nonconformities to CAPA closure (links to W387 CSA evidence and the independent VS-21 audit)
Responsible (R): IT Compliance Lead / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 40 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5522_Task8" name="Certification &amp; surveillance management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Certification &amp; surveillance management: Coordinate stage-1/stage-2/surveillance audits with the certification body; remediate findings
Responsible (R): IT Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 32 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5522_Task9" name="Management review &amp; reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Management review &amp; reporting: Run the annual management review; report security-GRC metrics to the CIO/Board (ethics escalations link to W119)
Responsible (R): IT Compliance Lead
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 8 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5522_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5522_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5522_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5522_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-324 (ensure controlled execution — Cybersecurity &amp; Privacy (PA-27.3).) | - operational: the policy set carries CIO approval and current annual review dates | - operational: nonconformities tracked to CAPA closure before the surveillance audit
Owner: IT Compliance Lead (accountable: CIO)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
